@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = sivmi_GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN_API_CLIENT
@leadId = 1

### Menerima daftar lead
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads?status=Cold&per_page=25
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Menerima detail lead
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mengirim/membuat lead
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: lead-local-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "nama": "Calon Siswa Contoh",
  "no_wa": "081234567890",
  "status_lead": "Cold",
  "sumber_lead": "Instagram",
  "tanggal_masuk": "2026-08-25"
}

### Uji validasi
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: validation-local-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "nama": "Data tanpa nomor WhatsApp"
}
